questionText:
View and examine the following statement.
SELECT GREATEST(12, 45, 7, 30) FROM dual;
What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT LEAST('PEAR', 'APPLE', 'MANGO') FROM dual;
What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT INSTR('2024-05-17', '-') FROM dual;
What does this statement return?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT ROUND(2.5), ROUND(-2.5) FROM dual;
What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT TRUNC(4728, -2) FROM dual;
What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT LPAD('HelloWorld', 5) FROM dual;
The pad length (5) is shorter than the original string. What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT RTRIM('Hello###', '#') FROM dual;
What is the result?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT SUM(DISTINCT salary) FROM employees WHERE department_id = 50;
What does SUM(DISTINCT salary) calculate?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT * FROM employees WHERE commission_pct = NULL;
What happens when this statement is executed?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT CAST('99999' AS NUMBER(3)) FROM dual;
What happens when this statement is executed?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM hire_date) FROM employees WHERE employee_id = 100;
What does EXTRACT(YEAR FROM hire_date) return?

View and examine the following statement.
SELECT TRUNC(DATE '2024-08-20', 'YEAR') FROM dual;
What is the result?
